WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.031 --> 00:00:06.441
"We can't wait a week!" Ringo said.

2
00:00:06.442 --> 00:00:09.083
"Captain Nova will be mad!

3
00:00:09.084 --> 00:00:13.288
Commander Cosmo will be mad!"

4
00:00:13.289 --> 00:00:18.732
Lucy folded her arms. "I'll be mad!"

5
00:00:18.733 --> 00:00:23.403
Ringo looked down. "Sorry, Lucy."

6
00:00:23.404 --> 00:00:26.043
"Don't worry," the worker said.

7
00:00:26.044 --> 00:00:28.743
"I have a spaceship you can rent."

8
00:00:28.744 --> 00:00:36.942
"Great!" Ringo said.

9
00:00:36.943 --> 00:00:46.242
The worker led them to a big garage.

10
00:00:46.243 --> 00:00:55.400
A junky old spaceship sat inside.

11
00:00:55.401 --> 00:01:01.354
"How old is this spaceship?" Lucy asked.

12
00:01:01.355 --> 00:01:05.249
The worker smiled. "It's very old!

13
00:01:05.250 --> 00:01:10.873
But it still works."

14
00:01:10.874 --> 00:01:12.821
Ringo got Bot.

15
00:01:12.822 --> 00:01:20.043
He put in the new hex link.

16
00:01:20.044 --> 00:01:23.748
Ding!

17
00:01:23.749 --> 00:01:29.394
"I feel much better now!" Bot said.

18
00:01:29.395 --> 00:01:37.581
They all got into the junky old spaceship.

19
00:01:37.582 --> 00:01:40.973
"I can fly this," Bot said.

20
00:01:40.974 --> 00:01:44.033
"It's old, like me!"

21
00:01:44.034 --> 00:01:46.489
"Good," Lucy said.

22
00:01:46.490 --> 00:01:50.521
"Because Ringo is a terrible pilot."

23
00:01:50.522 --> 00:01:59.849
Ringo rolled his eyes.

24
00:01:59.850 --> 00:02:04.338
The old spaceship blasted off.

25
00:02:04.339 --> 00:02:08.643
Bang! Bang! It shook.

26
00:02:08.644 --> 00:02:12.152
"Ouch! Oof!" Lucy said.

27
00:02:12.153 --> 00:02:20.622
Ringo held onto his seat.

28
00:02:20.623 --> 00:02:24.124
Green smoke came out of the control panel.

29
00:02:24.125 --> 00:02:27.936
Lucy held her nose. "Yuck!"

30
00:02:27.937 --> 00:02:39.814
Ringo sighed. "This is going to be a long ride."

